    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000si51](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000si51) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 22.194 depth occurred on May 04 2026 2 km SE of Zocoteaca de León, Mexico. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 16.6223 longitude -97.9846. It impacted 271437 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
